# Find minimum energy fcc configuration
# Mark Tschopp, 2010

# ---------- Initialize Simulation --------------------- 
clear 
units metal 
dimension 3 
boundary p p p 
atom_style atomic 
atom_modify map array

# ---------- Create Atoms --------------------- 
lattice 	fcc 2
region	box block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units lattice
create_box	1 box
lattice	fcc 4 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1  
create_atoms 1 box
replicate 1 1 1

mass 1 26.98

write_data structure.xyz 

